meta {
  name: Membership Checkout
  type: http
  seq: 2
}
post {
  url: {{base_url}}/membership/checkout
}
headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
}
docs {
  Isolated Stripe test environment only. Creates or reuses an owned Checkout session.
  Expected 409 before launch, 503 without configuration, 409 if already subscribed.
  No charge occurs until a separate real payment in Stripe Checkout.
}
